cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the harmonised data table, please cite the
  accompanying article (preferred) and, where the software itself matters,
  the archived Zenodo release.
title: "UHI: Continuous Morphology Archetypes for Heat Mitigation Across Cities"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline, configs, notebooks and harmonised per-patch morphology-UHI table for the
  66-city continuous-morphology study published in Sustainable Cities and Society.
  Implements ingest, feature extraction, mixed-effects and XGBoost+SHAP attribution,
  empirical Pareto extraction, and morphology archetype clustering.
